OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal welfare campaigner died of
OL,4,Athyroid cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of an animal welfare
OL,7,Fadvocate who died three months after
OL,8,Fbeing diagnosed with thyroid cancer
OL,9,Fdescribed her as embodying "the very
OL,10,Fessence of what it means to thrive", at
OL,11,Fan inquest into her death.
OL,13,FSarah Fisher, who ran the Tilley Farm
OL,14,Fsanctuary for rescued horses, ponies
OL,15,Fand donkeys, lived in Bath with her
OL,16,Fpartner, the late actor Anthony Head -
OL,17,Ffamous for Buffy the Vampire Slayer and
OL,18,FLittle Britain.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
