OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal welfare campaigner died of
OL,4,Athyroid cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 61-year-old died at home surrounded
OL,7,Fby her family on 23 December, after
OL,8,Fundergoing radiotherapy and
OL,9,Fchemotherapy.
OL,11,FA statement from her daughter Emily
OL,12,FHead, who is known for her roles in The
OL,13,FInbetweeners and Emmerdale, said Fisher
OL,14,Fhad been "busy living" amid her
OL,15,Fterminal diagnosis.
